            // Terrain radius, StarCraft II min(InnerRadius, Radius): 5.0.14 InnerRadius 0.3125 (voidmulti UnitData:1528; liberty:4745 0.375); Radius 0.375. Blizzard 5.0.13 patch notes: worker inner radius 0.375 to 0.3125.
            terrain_radius: Some(0.3125),
